        "text": "=Hej! Welcome to AIGroceryAgent! 🛒✨\n\nI help across Denmark to track down the best promotional deals at local supermarkets like Netto 🟡 and REMA-1000 🔵 Lidl and Fotex (more stores joining soon! 🚀).\n\n📝 Send me your shopping list or whatever you're craving:\n🥩 Meat & Poultry • 🥦 Veggies • 🍎 Fruits • 🥛 Dairy & Skyr • 🥣 Oats & Staples • 🥤 Sodas • 🍺 Beer & Wine\n\n...and I’ll recommend the lowest prices among all the stores.! 🔍⚡\n\n🗓️✨ Quick tip: Fresh weekly flyer deals drop every Sunday morning! 🎯🇩🇰",
